<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Landscape Design — Chief Cornerstone</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/public.css">
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>
<section class="service-hero" style="background-image:url('/images/service-design.jpg')">
  <div class="service-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container service-hero-content">
    <div class="service-hero-tag">Our Services</div>
    <h1>Landscape Design</h1>
    <p>Custom outdoor spaces designed for Texas living — beautiful, functional, and built to last.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="service-page-grid">
      <div class="service-page-content">
        <h2>Transform Your Outdoor Space</h2>
        <p>Great landscape design starts with listening. We take the time to understand how you use your outdoor space, what you love about it, and what you wish were different. Then we design something that actually works for your life and your Texas climate.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">From a simple bed refresh to a complete backyard transformation, we handle every step — design, plant selection, installation, and follow-up care.</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:16px">What's Included</h3>
        <ul class="service-list">
          <li>On-site consultation and property assessment</li>
          <li>Custom design plan with plant selections</li>
          <li>Texas-native and drought-tolerant options</li>
          <li>Soil analysis and amendment recommendations</li>
          <li>Full installation by our crew</li>
          <li>Before & after documentation</li>
          <li>Post-installation care guidance</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="scripture" style="margin-top:36px">
          <span>"He makes me lie down in green pastures, he leads me beside quiet waters."</span>
          <cite>— Psalm 23:2</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-page-sidebar">
        <div class="service-sidebar-card">
          <h4>Ready to Get Started?</h4>
          <p>Contact us for a free design consultation. We'll walk your property and share our vision.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-green" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:16px">Request a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-sidebar-card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h4>Other Services</h4>
          <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0">
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/lawn-maintenance" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Lawn Maintenance</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/tree-trimming" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Tree & Shrub Trimming</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/irrigation" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Irrigation Systems</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cream-dark)"><a href="/services/hardscaping" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Hardscaping</a></li>
            <li style="padding:8px 0"><a href="/services/seasonal-cleanup" style="color:var(--green-dark);text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem">→ Seasonal Cleanup</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section-cta">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center">
    <h2>Let's Design Something Beautiful</h2>
    <p>Free consultation — no pressure, no obligation.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold" style="margin-top:28px">Request a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
